  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Happy!!! <span><ruby>운<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>쟝 졩<ruby>과<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tmraRTcytUE?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>佇<rt>듸-</rt></ruby><ruby>每<rt>뮈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一工<rt>짇강ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>五點半<rt>꺼댬ˆ봘</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ti-mûi-jit-kâng’e gor-tiâm-poa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    Good morning <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>共<rt>가-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𠢕<rt>ᄁᅷ-</rt></ruby><ruby>早<rt>자ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    Good morning goà ka-lì gau-jà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>睏<rt>쿤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>豬<rt>듸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>金金<rt>김ˉ김ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì khùn-kâh-chīn-chiṵ-tî goà kīm-kīm-khoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>逐工<rt>닥강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>努力<rt>러ˆ롁ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>嫌<rt>햠-</rt></ruby><ruby>晏<rt>왈</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tak-kâng lôr-liêk lông-bo-hiam-oa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>只要<rt>지ˆᄋᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>身軀<rt>신ˉ쿠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>勇健<rt>영ˆ걀ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會當<rt>에당ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>聽<rt>턀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>唱歌<rt>츌ˋ과ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà jî-yàu-sīn-khû yông-kiā̰ e-tàng-thiā̰-lì chiṵ̀-koâ\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby> 가<ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>惜<rt>숗ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>命<rt>먀-</rt></ruby><ruby>命<rt>먀ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phâh-pia̰ ka-lì siôh-mia-miā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>小心<rt>쇼ˆ심ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>駕駛<rt>가ˋ수ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>以後<rt>이ˆᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>路<rt>러ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做伙<rt>조ˋ훼ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>行<rt>걀ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goà e-siô-sīm-kà-sù î-āu’e lōr làn lông-jò-huê-kiá̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>困難<rt>쿤ˋ란ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>阻礙<rt>저ˆ깨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-siâ̰-mîh khùn-lán bo-siâ̰-mîh jôr-gāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>提<rt>테-</rt></ruby><ruby>出<rt>춛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>氣力<rt>퀴ˋ랃ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>理想<rt>리ˆ셩ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    the-chût-khùi-lât làn’e lî-siòng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>遺憾<rt>위함ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓-</rt></ruby><ruby>怨嘆<rt>완ˋ탄</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-siâ̰-mîh wi-hām bo-siâ̰-mih-oàn-than\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>準備<rt>준ˆ비-</rt></ruby><ruby>好勢<rt>호ˆ세</rt></ruby> <ruby>란<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>向<rt>형ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>前<rt>졘-</rt></ruby><ruby>衝<rt>쳥ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jûn-pi-hô-se làn hiòng-jien-chiông\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>平安<rt>볭안ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>快樂<rt>쾌ˋ럭ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ài-pieng-ân khoài-lôrk\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿 Happy’에 <ruby>運<rt>운ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>將<rt>쟝</rt></ruby>, <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>去<rt>킈ˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>底位<rt>도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby>?</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh Happy’e ùn-jiang, lì bêh-khì-tô-wī?\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    Happy’에 <ruby>運<rt>운ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>將<rt>쟝</rt></ruby>, <ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>鐵<rt>팋ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍<rt>팧</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    Happy’e ùn-jiang, lî-thîh-phah’e sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>美麗<rt>삐ˆ레ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>家<rt>게ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>佮<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>婀娜<rt>오ˉ너ˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>扛<rt>긍ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>起<rt>키ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-tioh-bî-lē’e kê kâh-ō-nòr’e lì lai-kn̄g-khì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>毋<rt>음-</rt></ruby><ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>日頭<rt>띧ᄐᅷˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>曝<rt>팍ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>大雨<rt>돠허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>沃<rt>악</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>食<rt>쟣-</rt></ruby><ruby>苦<rt>커ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做<rt>조ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>食<rt>쟣-</rt></ruby><ruby>甜<rt>딜ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    m-kiā̰-rit-tháu lai-phâk, toa-hōr lai-ak, jiah-khòr jò-jiah-tḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>叫<rt>교ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>頂真<rt>뎽ˆ진ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì kiò-goà ài-tiêng-jîn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    不要玩手機\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bù yào wán shǒu jī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>開車<rt>퀴ˉ챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一定<rt>읻ˆ뎽-</rt></ruby><ruby>애<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>頭前<rt>ᄐᅷ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khūi-chiâ ît-tieng-ài-khoà̰-thau-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    옿 Happy’에 <ruby>運<rt>운ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>將<rt>쟝</rt></ruby>, <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>對<rt>위ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>底<rt>되ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>去<rt>킈</rt></ruby>?</span>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    oh Happy’e ùn-jiang, lì bêh-wì-toê-khi?\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    Happy’에 <ruby>運<rt>운ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>將<rt>쟝</rt></ruby>, <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>暝<rt>미-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>띧ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    Happy’e ùn-jiang, lì bo-mi-bo-rît\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為<rt>위-</rt></ruby><ruby>著